translated_text:
Article 22
(1) The form of Regional Government services to victims implemented by UPTD PPA and others as referred to in Article 21 includes:
a. Medical services;
b. Medicolegal services (visum);
c. Psychosocial services;
d. Legal services;
e. Economic independence services;
